classDiagram
    class Owner {
        +str name
        +List~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet: Pet) None
        +get_all_tasks() List~Task~
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +int age
        +List~Task~ tasks
        +get_info() str
        +add_task(task: Task) None
        +get_tasks() List~Task~
    }

    class Task {
        +str description
        +Time time
        +str frequency
        +bool completed
        +str priority
        +int duration_minutes
        +complete_task() None
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +add_task(pet: Pet, task: Task) None
        +schedule_tasks() List~Task~
        +get_pending_tasks() List~Task~
        +get_todays_tasks() List~Task~
        -_sort_tasks(tasks: List~Task~) List~Task~
    }

    Owner "1" --> "*" Pet : owns
    Pet "1" --> "*" Task : has
    Scheduler --> Owner : schedules for
    Scheduler --> Task : manages